0x338.jpg?t=1758131833"}],"short_description":"Perform life-saving operations in this fast-paced surgery sim. As lizard surgeon Dr. Peri Maddock, you'll treat injuries, excise tumors, and hack corporate organs with speedy, surgical precision. The patient's life is in your claws!","steam_appid":3639510,"support_info":{"email":"support@wizbirdgames.com","url":"https://www.wizbirdgames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://www.wizbirdgames.com/"}